physicalRef: service_order/database
description: "Electricity revenue-protection Link Analysis showcase - One row per service order (connect, disconnect, reconnect, meter_swap): when it was raised, the contractor who closed it and when (both blank while open). One landed extract; the next month is in data/staged. Landed by the service_order Pipeline. Synthetic."
eventDate: raised_at
columns[6]{name,type,classification}:
  order_id,string,
  premise_id,string,
  order_type,string,
  raised_at,timestamp,
  closed_by,string,
  closed_at,timestamp,
